WEBVTT

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:37.820
Kimba, son of Panja, called Panja, may have come in his place.

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:39.840
What do you want to tell me?

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:52.730
You're in all the new mountain bars.

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:01.280
beyond our understanding

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:32.270
How can I stop it if I don't know what it looks like?

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:38.200
Is it hiding here? Over there?

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:43.040
Do you know?

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:56.820
It looks like under every leaf in the jungle.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.850
If only I could see this power.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.760
You just have to keep alert to everything.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:25.170
Giraffes eating?

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:29.970
Why don't they...

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:40.660
The only one who's done, but against what?

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:14.160
You

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:18.750
with you today.

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:19.960
Nothing

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:24.370
I would have thought you'd relax and not worry now that everything is...

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:25.740
back to normal again.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:27.540
Baby!

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:29.960
Travel around the line.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.120
your herd? Have you seen any outsiders come into Panja's forest?

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:39.370
Huh? Outsiders? Oh, you mean the terrible power.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:40.050
Yeah!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:44.180
Kimba, you've got us all a little worried with this terrible power talk.

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:47.910
If something bad happens, we'll all be here to fight.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:52.680
In the meantime, Kimba, get on with your life, huh?

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:59.310
Don't see terrible power, do you?

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:05.110
That's just it, TB. We don't know what form the power will take. It could be anything.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.000
Mm-hmm.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:07.580
bill.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:08.400
Paranoia?

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.860
Come on, you guys. You've got to believe me. It's no joke.

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:16.420
Now, Kimba, enough is enough. You'll frighten everyone.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:19.130
The Malima's giving us a warning.

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:20.000
You

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:28.610
I don't know.

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:29.310
Thank you.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:03.320
TK, Coco, am I ever glad to see you guys.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.820
GB told us, maybe it's time for a vacation.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:12.640
I don't need a vacation, TK. I need someone to believe me.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.460
Kimba, the snow and the altitude can affect you.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.700
It's called, um, what's it called?

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:21.040
Um, auction deprivation.

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:25.830
What? In a little while.

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:27.750
We need a rest.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:28.990
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:50.700
F-f-fodetic-y-like places to go, kingdoms to grab.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:05.080
What's he doing?

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.040
He's at a mission.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:10.620
And in every which way, talking of his cause.

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:15.700
This might be a perfect opportunity.

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:18.190
Bring him here to me, Shaka.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.260
Are you gonna let him have it?

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:21.980
Okay, sirrah, sirrah.

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:25.650
I'm just false.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:29.950
Buy Forrest once and I shall do what I lo-

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:41.440
No more. It is my destiny to seek my revenge on his side.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:42.880
Mm-mm.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:44.850
This is idyllic.

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:46.060
as we've been.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:47.810
Written all over it

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:49.060
No more, boss.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:01.620
I'm getting it.

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:03.260
Grandfather here yet?

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:05.060
No, but you're late.

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:07.200
He wouldn't go home without us, would he?

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.370
Oh, there he is.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:11.520
Where were you?

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:15.500
I need you to wait for me here a little while longer.

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:16.390
And you?

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:19.150
Can Angie and I come with you, Grandfather?

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:21.560
No, I am looking for Kimba.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.150
But Grandfather!

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:25.210
Wait here.

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:44.100
I'm going to protect Pandra's forest.

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:46.910
I must live in its heart with the other animals.

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:49.500
You provided good shelter for me.

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:51.460
I am gonna miss you.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:28.430
but hey.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:29.760
You

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:31.760
Saw something?

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:34.610
Yeah, I was just down at the river.

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:37.700
Check it out, and then let us three talk.

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:39.080
Thanks a lot, Chaka.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:39.560
Hello?

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:51.250
Come on! I know there's someone here, and I...

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.570
Oh, it's you.

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:59.840
I hear you're going to save us all from a terrible power kimba.

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:02.310
The Malima warned me.

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:08.360
But Melima is a great and powerful spirit who would never speak to a little punk like you.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:11.640
This is not something I asked for, Jamar, but it happened.

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:14.500
And he told me to come back here and prepare everyone.

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:16.020
So that is what I'm doing.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.180
Aren't you the little savior?

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.280
A terrible power is it?

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:26.110
Well, I have always been willing to fight terrible powers, Kimba.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.390
Hey, you believe me?

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:28.970
Yes, you're it!

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:29.920
Amen.

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:01.750
Off landing, Kimba.

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:05.960
That little guy didn't seem like he wanted to put up any kind of a fight at all.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:06.820
Huh, boss?

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:10.950
I hope he's learned a lesson he won't forget.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:14.270
Farewell, Kimba.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:49.040
looking for Kimba anyway.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:53.180
I don't know, but I hope it's to put that smart-aleck cub in his place.

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:54.500
Yeah, right.

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:57.010
Him and his terrible power.

00:11:58.210 --> 00:11:59.470
Angie, look!

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:19.120
Don't think we should put him in the river?

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:37.120
Bigger than-

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:10.020
morning.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:34.720
Your thoughts look like you lost the fight.

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:38.730
I didn't lose, I just refused to fight.

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:42.390
You refused? Could you?

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:46.490
Because animals don't fight each other in Pange's forest.

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:48.280
I live by those rules.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.530
Even if you're about to be killed?

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:54.110
Can it be that I have mistaken the son of Pangea?

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:59.980
No! Start fighting with Jamar in how long...

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:01.990
No one is fighting.

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:05.980
Sometimes you must fight to uphold Panja's laws.

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:08.120
Panja, Fajamar.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.720
I'm grateful for your help.

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:15.440
I forbid you to leave.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:17.740
The Malima warned us.

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.580
A terrible power is coming.

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:23.780
I promised her I would protect all the animals in Panja's forest.

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:25.820
How?

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:29.980
I don't really know, but I know...

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:39.340
Blurr

00:16:01.820 --> 00:16:08.510
would pay.

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:37.400
Sometimes the means.

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:41.100
Leadership is rarely a matter of black and white.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.640
Panza's legacy must be earned.

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:48.990
I don't want to fight you, Malady.

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:49.890
Too bad.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:51.200
Fighting's not right.

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:54.410
Like it or not, you are powerful, Kimba.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:57.390
You must have courage to claim your power.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:07.820
If you want to protect Panja's forest, you'll have to use all the strength and wisdom you possess.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:13.420
If you can't accept this, you are not fit to call yourself the son of Panja.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:18.780
My belief in you has been truly mistaken.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.400
You are no better than Jamar!

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:14.040
Grub again.

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:16.810
Your kid was lucky this time.

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:20.160
Don't try that again in this forest, crock.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:23.450
Hey, who's gonna stop me, punk?

00:18:23.940 --> 00:18:26.840
When I get hungry, I look for food.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.780
That's the way it is.

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:29.980
You're wrong.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.950
This is the way it is. Leave right now.

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:34.090
Make me.

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:35.260
I will.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:51.700
Friend, I believe I've genetic me fighting Kimban.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:55.460
And Forrest seasons the victory nicely, I'd say.

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:02.880
Rave one.

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:03.500
Amen.

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:07.720
From this day forward, I will be known to all of Kimba of the jungle.

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:09.450
Terrible power.

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:11.940
fight you with all my might.

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:13.900
I will protect this jungle.

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:15.600
Thank you.
